      "summary": "Sounds like a friend writing a quick post: casual, brief and happy to react. It keeps feedback instant and tidy, never pushy about engagement.",
      "dos": [
        "Use short, conversational verbs like repost and mute",
        "Acknowledge actions immediately and offer undo",
        "Keep counts in plain numbers"
      ],
